/* dumptab:  a program to de-compile nroff drive tables so they can
**		be fiddled with.
**
** usage:	dumptab tab300 > Tab300.c
**
** Matt Crawford, University of Chicago, 10 May 1984
** ihnp4!oddjob!matt		   matt@anl-mcs.arpa
